cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use WPGT Mirante, please cite it as below."
title: "WPGT Mirante"
abstract: >-
  A WikiProject GeoTwin tool for 3D browsing of the Wikimedia Commons photos of a place. Photos are placed by
  structure-from-motion (COLMAP), georeferenced against accurately positioned (RTK) survey photos or their own
  geotags, and shown in a static web viewer that moves and cross-fades between neighbouring photos.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Rafael
    family-names: Lemieszek
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/rlemieszek/wpgt-mirante"
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - Wikimedia Commons
  - WikiProject GeoTwin
  - structure-from-motion
  - photogrammetry
  - cultural heritage
  - 3D viewer
